  "question": {
    "text": "Given \\(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{A}}=2 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+3 \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}\\) and \\(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}=\\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+\\hat{\\mathrm{j}}\\). The component of vector \\(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{A}}\\) along vector \\(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{B}}\\) is",
